  "bodyHash": "RTYp4BxVz84=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">为Bosses of Mass Destruction添加的Boss奖励扩展<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1058/637/gauntlet_mini_textured_2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"246\" height=\"400\"><br><br>迷你铁拳<br></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">一个可驯服的小型下界铁拳<br>通过放置迷你铁拳物品召唤<br>使用下界之星右击激活<br>可放入桶中<br>喂红石粉可为其恢复生命<br><br>属性：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 100 生命值&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 4 护甲值&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 10 攻击力<br><br>能力：<br>- 拳击<br>- 激光<br><br>行为：<br>- 闲逛<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 跟随<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">- 停留&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>- 跳舞&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><br>死亡时掉落一个迷你铁拳物品<br>该物品包含其所有数据<br>需要1分钟充能后才能再次放置<br>可配置为具有发光效果</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><br>需要前置模组：<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BOMD (Forge版)</a></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
